{"rpid": "494659557", "root": "494656074", "parent": "494656074", "uname": "Noble_Carter", "mid": "7245140", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "原歌词\nDovahkiin, Dovahkiin \nnaal ok zin los vahriin \nwah dein vokul mahfaeraak ahst vaal! \nAhrk fin norok paal graan \nfod nust hon zindro zaan \nDovahkiin, fah hin kogaan mu draal! \n\nHuzrah nu, kul do od, wah aan bok lingrah vod \nAahrk fin tey, boziik fun, do fin gein! \nWo lost fron wah ney dov \nahrk fin reyliik do jul \nvoth aan suleyk wah ronit faal krein! \nVey zeim hokoron pah, ol fin Dovahkiin komeyt ok rein! \nAlduin, feyn do jun, \nkruziik vokun staadnau, \nvoth aan bahlok wah diivon fin lein! \n\nNuz aan sul, fent alok, \nfod fin vul dovah nok, \nfen kos nahlot mahfaeraak ahrk ruz! \nPaaz Keizaal fen kos stin nol bein Alduin jot! \n\nDovahkiin, Dovahkiin \nnaal ok zin los vahriin \nwah dein vokul mahfaeraak ahst vaal! \nAhrk fin norok paal graan \nfod nust hon zindro zaan \nDovahkiin, fah hin kogaan mu draal!", "like": 2, "ctime": 1511932571, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "579428", "video_bvid": "BV1Ds411Z7oB", "video_title": "【老滚5】Sons of Skyrim-Peter Hollens", "video_desc": "youku 老滚5的《Sons Of Skyrim》 这位仁兄唱的超有气势 热血沸腾", "video_owner": "战车蜻蜓", "video_view": 21412, "video_reply": 54, "video_n1": 29, "video_n2": 25}
{"rpid": "494664481", "root": "494656074", "parent": "494656074", "uname": "Noble_Carter", "mid": "7245140", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "翻译\n龙裔，龙裔 \n以他的荣誉宣誓 \n将罪恶永远扼杀在摇篮中！ \n把邪恶的敌人击溃！ \n当他们听到胜利的号角\n龙裔，我们为你的祝福而祈祷！ \n\n现在请倾听！天际的子孙们！在很久以前的一个年代\n这个故事，将无忌讳地传颂！ \n谁是龙的亲属\n和其种族的人\n与太阳的权力斗争 \n砍杀所有的敌人 \n龙裔发出他的吼声！ \n时间之神，是灾祸的帝王， \n古老的阴影释放着黑暗 \n因为饥饿而吞下这个世界！ \n\n但是站起来！ \n邪恶之龙的谎言 \n会因为我们而永远地消散！ \n和平的天际会在时间之神的手中解放获得自由！ \n\n龙裔，龙裔 \n以他的荣誉宣誓 \n将罪恶永远扼杀在摇篮中！ \n把邪恶的敌人击溃！ \n当他们听到胜利的号角 \n龙裔，我们为你的祝福而祈祷！", "like": 5, "ctime": 1511932907, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "579428", "video_bvid": "BV1Ds411Z7oB", "video_title": "【老滚5】Sons of Skyrim-Peter Hollens", "video_desc": "youku 老滚5的《Sons Of Skyrim》 这位仁兄唱的超有气势 热血沸腾", "video_owner": "战车蜻蜓", "video_view": 21412, "video_reply": 54, "video_n1": 29, "video_n2": 25}
